# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private documentation — NEVER commit.
#
#   context/  real personal data: income figures, bank account structure,
#             assets, third-party information.
#   docs/     design documentation. Derived from the real household above, so
#             it is treated as context-model material even though it is written
#             in the abstract.
#
# Excluded deliberately, from the first commit. Publishable documentation
# (usage guides, testing and test-case docs) will live elsewhere and is written
# in English — see README.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
context/
docs/
*.private.md
*.local.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Local endpoints, not secrets. Anything sensitive belongs in .env.local, which stays ignored.
!.env.development
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
*.pfx
*.key
secrets.json

